{"schema_version":"1.0","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-hn7/","title":"구후 EX-HN7","language":"ko-KR","description":"경외기혈 구후의 위치·취혈·자침 정보를 정리합니다.","text":"구후 EX-HN7\n분류\n경외기혈 · 코드 EX-HN7\n위치\n눈확 아래 모서리에서 바깥쪽 1/4와 안쪽 3/4의 지점.\n취혈\n자침·주의\n눈확 아래 모서리에서 바깥쪽아래로부터 안쪽위로 0.5～1寸 刺入.\n임상 연결\n경외기혈은 관련 부위·증상과 14경맥의 경혈을 함께 보고 배혈합니다.\n→ 경외기혈 통합 목록","headings":[{"level":2,"title":"분류","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-hn7/#_1"},{"level":2,"title":"위치","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-hn7/#_2"},{"level":2,"title":"취혈","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-hn7/#_3"},{"level":2,"title":"자침·주의","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-hn7/#_4"},{"level":2,"title":"임상 연결","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-hn7/#_5"}],"links":["https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupoint-network/extra-points/"],"related_reading":[],"interpretation":"Public article text and navigation only; links do not establish clinical equivalence or treatment recommendations."}
